1
00:00:00,264 --> 00:00:02,304
(Leonard:)Well, yeah.

2
00:00:04,201 --> 00:00:05,301
(Sheldon:)Wow.

3
00:00:11,308 --> 00:00:14,658
(Sheldon:)How dare the university force me
to go back to string theory!

4
00:00:14,812 --> 00:00:16,482
(Amy:)They just don't appreciate you.

5
00:00:16,647 --> 00:00:19,127
(Sheldon:)Yeah, and on top of that,
Leonard has the audacity

6
00:00:19,283 --> 00:00:21,493
(Sheldon:)to suggest that now
that he and Penny are engaged,

7
00:00:21,652 --> 00:00:23,652
(Sheldon:)he may not want
to live with me anymore.

8
00:00:23,821 --> 00:00:25,601
(Amy:)Here, I made you
some Strawberry Quik.

9
00:00:25,756 --> 00:00:27,496
(Sheldon:)I have real problems here, Amy.

10
00:00:27,658 --> 00:00:30,398
(Sheldon:)I can't be mollified with
a beverage designed for children.

11
00:00:31,495 --> 00:00:32,995
(Sheldon:)Mm. Yummy.

12
00:00:35,065 --> 00:00:36,665
(Raj:)You know,
this might work out for the best.

13
00:00:36,834 --> 00:00:40,114
(Amy:)You're always complaining about
what a terrible roommate Leonard is.

14
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:42,840
(Amy:)Like how he turns up
the thermostat when you're not there.

15
00:00:43,006 --> 00:00:46,356
(Sheldon:)Ugh. It's like
walking into the Amazon.

16
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,580
(Sheldon:)And not the good Amazon
with one-day shipping.

17
00:00:48,745 --> 00:00:51,155
(Sheldon:)The awful one with birds and snakes.

18
00:00:52,349 --> 00:00:54,799
(Amy:)You hate the sound of all
those keys on his key chain.

19
00:00:54,952 --> 00:00:56,862
(Sheldon:)Four keys!

20
00:00:57,020 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)Who does he think he is, a warden?

